+    SAME line as the container-side mount target, the way #1610 made install scripts
+    source-aware (#1597): a container target alone cannot attribute the patch, because two
+    patches can mount at paths that overlap as substrings (``/chat_template.jinja`` is a
+    SUFFIX of every model-dir target) and any compose that mounts SOME template would then
+    match every one of them.
