+# #1610 follow-up — chat_template patches must not reach composes that ship a
+# DIFFERENT patch's template. The bare `--chat-template` flag is a substring of
+# `--chat-template-file` and every template-shipping compose passes some flag, so
+# flag-alone "reached" 47 Gemma / qwen3.6 / GLM composes for the qwen38 patch and 87
+# vLLM composes for apex / glm53. These controls MUST fail on the pre-fix code.
+_ct_xmap = {p["id"]: p for p in chat_template_patches}
+for _pid, _slug in (
+    ("qwen38-reasoning-effort-template", "vllm/gemma-31b-dual"),   # a Gemma compose
